  m_text: "Welcome to your first day! \n\nHere is your workplace, it is a bit rusty
    in here, but do feel at home!\n \nOh, and you might want to check outside from
    time to time, the previous worker mentioned something like that the last time
    I saw him. \n\nAnyways, enjoy your shift!"
